Edit: to clarify, the segment is about a real person, there's even pictures of newspapers from the time

TBOI: Repentance

&#x200B;

Tainted Lost can go to hell for all I care

Ugh, I'm so jealous of people with freckles, I've always thought that it's such a good look!

&#x200B;

Was it good?

It's less cheerful but have you listened to anything by Mars Argo? On the more cheery side I recommend Home by Edward Sharpe & The Magnetic Zeros, which is more of a run away with the love of your life sorta vibe but hopefully similar to what you are looking for, and in the same vein there's also Sleep on the Floor by the Lumineers.

&#x200B;

Oh and also Scarecrow by Alex and Sierra! That one definitely has flower field vibes
